5
00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:21.899
"I'll be back."

6
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.211
*** Roxy found Detective Smith in the North American

7
00:00:25.212 --> 00:00:27.367
wing. He was talking to a

8
00:00:27.368 --> 00:00:30.496
guard. "Hey, Detective," Roxy

9
00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:33.554
said. "Is your school here on a field

10
00:00:33.555 --> 00:00:35.908
trip?" Detective Smith rolled his

11
00:00:35.909 --> 00:00:42.341
eyes. "Very funny, Rocket Girl. I don't go to school

12
00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.133
anymore." "So what's going on?" Roxy

13
00:00:45.134 --> 00:00:49.292
asked. "Mayor Bloom said a valuable artifact is

14
00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:53.637
missing." The guard nodded. "A gold ring is

15
00:00:53.638 --> 00:00:55.734
