A man hurried into the room. "What's going on?"

18
00:01:04.132 --> 00:01:05.966
The guard looked nervous.

19
00:01:05.967 --> 00:01:08.250
"Professor Beard," she said.

20
00:01:08.251 --> 00:01:12.287
"The gold ring is missing. I called the police."

21
00:01:12.288 --> 00:01:15.040
Professor Beard chuckled.

22
00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:18.158
"Don't be silly. Nothing is missing."

23
00:01:18.159 --> 00:01:21.455
"Huh?" Detective Smith raised an eyebrow.

24
00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.188
The guard frowned.

25
00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:26.616
"The ring is always in that case."

26
