28
00:01:30.945 --> 00:01:33.207
Roxy looked at the professor.

29
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.547
Then she looked at the guard.

30
00:01:35.548 --> 00:01:39.006
"Who's telling the truth?" she thought.

31
00:01:39.007 --> 00:01:44.085
"Are you serious, Professor?" The guard looked angry now.

32
00:01:44.086 --> 00:01:48.521
"There's even a sign with information about the gold ring!"

33
00:01:48.522 --> 00:01:52.148
She pointed at a small sign on the case.

34
00:01:52.149 --> 00:01:55.809
Roxy saw sweat drip down the professor's face.

35
00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:59.498
"Oh, um, I forgot," he said.

36
00:01:59.499 --> 00:02:02.594
"The ring was removed for cleaning."

37
00:02:02.595 --> 00:02:06.040
"I don't believe you, Professor," the guard said.

38
00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:09.417
Roxy and Detective Smith looked at Professor Beard.

39
00:02:09.418 --> 00:02:11.842
The professor puffed out his chest.

40
00:02:11.843 --> 00:02:14.648
"Fine! I'll tell you where the ring is.

41
00:02:14.649 --> 00:02:17.477
It's with its true owner!"

42
00:02:17.478 --> 00:02:20.407
The guard gasped.

43
00:02:20.408 --> 00:02:25.721
"Who's the real owner?" Detective Smith asked.

44
00:02:25.722 --> 00:02:28.136
Roxy read the sign on the case.

45
00:02:28.137 --> 00:02:34.943
"The ring belonged to an ancient caveman king named . . . King Trog?" She

46
00:02:34.944 --> 00:02:38.971
scratched her head. "That's a silly name." Detective

47
00:02:38.972 --> 00:02:42.965
Smith nodded. "It sure is." Professor

48
00:02:42.966 --> 00:02:45.791
Beard's face grew red. "How

49
00:02:45.792 --> 00:02:48.301
dare you insult my master!" "Your

50
00:02:48.302 --> 00:02:51.155
master ?" Roxy said.

51
00:02:51.156 --> 00:02:53.526
The professor ran away.

52
00:02:53.527 --> 00:03:00.916
"Hey!" Roxy flew after him.

53
00:03:00.917 --> 00:03:03.663
But a group of people got in her way.

54
00:03:03.664 --> 00:03:06.514
Professor Beard slipped through a door.

55
00:03:06.515 --> 00:03:09.487
"Rocket Girl!" Detective Smith called.

56
00:03:09.488 --> 00:03:12.381
Roxy flew back to the detective.

57
00:03:12.382 --> 00:03:14.355
He looked pale.

58
00:03:14.356 --> 00:03:18.036
"Professor Beard got away!" Roxy said.

59
00:03:18.037 --> 00:03:22.178
"We have a bigger problem now," Detective Smith said.

60
00:03:22.179 --> 00:03:25.035
"I just got a call from Mayor Bloom.

61
00:03:25.036 --> 00:03:30.429
King Trog is at City Hall!"

